	<KR_SettingModeLinear>线性（每级 +增量）</KR_SettingModeLinear>
	<KR_SettingFactor>指数倍率</KR_SettingFactor>
	<KR_SettingFactorDesc>指数模式下，每级要求变为上一级的该倍率。</KR_SettingFactorDesc>
	<KR_SettingIncrement>线性增量</KR_SettingIncrement>
	<KR_SettingIncrementDesc>线性模式下，每级比上一级多要求的击杀数。</KR_SettingIncrementDesc>
